NOTE ON THE UNDERLYING FIGURES
Each numeric figure in this dataset originates from a third-party primary source (e.g. Our
World in Data, the WHO, the World Bank, UNICEF, the UN, IRENA, The Carter Center). Those
figures remain under their respective source licenses, recorded per figure in the "source"
object of facts.json ("license" field). When reusing a specific number, attribute its
original source, not only this compilation.
